      {
        "id": "p13-q20-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$$\\begin{aligned}7^{2x-y}&=49\\\\2^{x+y}&=128\\end{aligned}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=3$ and $y=4$.",
          "worked": "Since $49=7^2$ and $128=2^7$, equating indices gives\n$$\\begin{align*}2x-y&=2\\\\x+y&=7.\\end{align*}$$\nAdding the equations:\n$$\\begin{align*}3x&=9\\\\x&=3\\\\3+y&=7\\\\y&=4.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      },
      {
        "id": "p13-q20-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$$\\begin{aligned}8^x\\div4^y&=4\\\\11^{y-x}&=\\frac{1}{11}\\end{aligned}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=0$ and $y=-1$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}8^x\\div4^y&=2^{3x}\\div2^{2y}\\\\8^x\\div4^y&=2^{3x-2y}.\\end{align*}$$\nSince $4=2^2$ and $\\frac{1}{11}=11^{-1}$, equating indices gives\n$$\\begin{align*}3x-2y&=2\\\\y-x&=-1\\\\y&=x-1.\\end{align*}$$\nSubstituting:\n$$\\begin{align*}3x-2(x-1)&=2\\\\x+2&=2\\\\x&=0\\\\y&=-1.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 84
      },
      {
        "id": "p13-q20-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$$\\begin{aligned}13^{x+4y}&=1\\\\25^{x+5y}&=5\\end{aligned}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-2$ and $y=\\frac{1}{2}$.",
          "worked": "Since $1=13^0$ and $25=5^2$,\n$$\\begin{align*}x+4y&=0\\\\5^{2x+10y}&=5^1\\\\2x+10y&=1\\\\x+5y&=\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{align*}$$\nSubtracting the first linear equation from the last:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\frac{1}{2}\\\\x+4\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)&=0\\\\x+2&=0\\\\x&=-2.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 78
      }
    ]
